                                "sense_id": "000409f0-73bd-33ef-985f-7864d0d27ea9",
                                "text": "snowy hillside"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2164f112-81d1-42f3-b8c1-58194c1d3c25",
                                "sense_id": "000409f0-73bd-33ef-985f-7864d0d27ea9",
                                "text": "So we continue climbing to the saddle of the Kleine Scheidegg, where ahead there comes into view the wide expanse of the Grindelwald valley, backed by the snowy crown of the Wetterhorn."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2976cb59-7309-3c8a-8270-f9e8b1636ab2",
                        "entry_id": "44b41e92-68c3-3c1d-b345-567313ee7c98",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Snow-white in color, white as snow."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
